OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after man dies in
OL,4,ALuton house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died at the scene of a house
OL,7,Ffire in Luton.
OL,9,FBedfordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid crews were called to the property
OL,11,Fin Icknield Way, near the junction of
OL,12,FNewbold Road, at 08:28 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,14,FWearing breathing apparatus,
OL,15,Ffirefighters said they used jets to
OL,16,Ftackle the flames and ventilated the
OL,17,Fbuilding after it was extinguished.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
